# Clearweb Health UX Standards

- Body text ≥ 16px; voice captions ≥ 18px; labels ≥ 13px
- Primary text `#F2F9F5` on `#070D0A`; secondary `#8BABA0`; never use `#4A6458` for primary content
- One focal point per phase; progressive disclosure for charts in results
- Min 44px tap targets; mic button 56px via VoiceShell
- Voice + UI sync: dashboard updates within 500ms of agent tags
- Include "AI guide — not medical advice" in voice UI
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` and components from `@/components/ui/`
- Framer springs only; respect `prefers-reduced-motion`
